+        // FG-178: VML cannot say "behind the text". The VML writer has no z-index for
+        // Writer's background (hell) layers, so a polygon there went out as a standalone
+        // <w:pict> that Word draws IN FRONT of the text -- while the text frames, written
+        // as DrawingML anchors, got behindDoc="1". PDF import puts every object in the
+        // background layer and many PDFs begin each page with a white full-page fill, so
+        // every page of such a PDF -> DOCX came out blank in Word. In DML the shape gets
+        // behindDoc="1" and its real z-order (relativeHeight), below the text it was
